, "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Float", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [403.5670471191406, 58], "pos": [2191.778076171875, 1736.4156494140625], "id": 83, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Float"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/MiniMax-Music3/tree/main/skills/music-caption-rewriter"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "MiniMax-AI/MiniMax-Music3 官方SKILL", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [440.82659912109375, 90.15805053710938], "pos": [2159.169189453125, 1086.4002685546875], "id": 78, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [{"name": "string", "links": [88], "label": "string", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["[Intro]\n这是我们的世界需要的\n每天都有更多的爱\n你和我都知道这一点。\n让我们从现在开始。\n\n[Chorus 1]\n抱着我\n别放开我\n就像被你迷住了一样\n我想要你\n来抱住我\n\n[Verse 1]\n我更接近一拳\n你能听到我的呼吸吗？\n热血奔腾\n是的，在许多不同的方面\n\n[Chorus 2]\n来抱我吧\n别放开我\n就像被你迷住了一样\n我想要你\n来抱住我\n\n[Verse 2]\n脉搏在跳动，我能看到你的表情\n哦，我处于无助的状态\n如果你愿意，我可以先得救\n现在提供口对口的方法\n\n[Chorus 3]\n抱着我\n别放开我\n就像被你迷住了一样\n我想要你\n来抱住我\n\n[Bridge]\n迷失和诱惑\n我被震撼和感动\n心跳得很厉害\n让你这样做太难了\n我想你看到了\n我越来越堕落了\n\n[Chorus 4]\n抱着我\n是的，抱着我\n别放开我\n就像被你迷住了一样\n我想要你\n来抱住我\n\n[Chorus 5]\n来抱着我\n别放开我\n就像被你迷住了一样\n我想要你\n来抱住我\n\n[Outro]\n哦，哦，哦\n会来抱我吗\n别放开我\n我想要你\n来抱住我"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Text", "title": "lyrics", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [441.9466247558594, 192.27301025390625], "pos": [2168.79248046875, 1481.297607421875], "id": 81, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"name": "string", "links": [89], "label": "string", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["Global Metadata\nMandopop power ballad with cinematic-pop and pop-rock textures. Mid-tempo ballad range (roughly 70–80 BPM), in a major key with an emotional minor-leaning bridge. The emotional arc moves from soft, hopeful anticipation through yearning and urgency into triumphant, cathartic climaxes, then settles into a resigned, bittersweet close. Production blends intimate, dry verses with a heavily layered, wall-of-sound chorus treatment; clean acoustic textures (piano, clean electric guitar, light bass, soft drums) gradually give way to distorted guitar accents, full string pads, and orchestral sweeps. Reverb and delay expand the soundstage for the climactic sections while the opening and close stay close and centered.\n\nVocal Details\nA single female lead voice, warm and intimate with a close-mic, slightly breathy quality in the lower register, blooming into resonant, powerful belts in the upper register. Delivery begins soft and yearning, grows urgent and driving through the verses, then turns explosive and anthemic in the choruses with sustained high notes. The bridge introduces emotional strain and a break into falsetto on the higher notes. Layered backing harmonies enter around the choruses and thicken into dense, choir-like stacks for the final sections; the fourth chorus adds double-tracked lead and call-and-response harmony. Effects remain restrained: subtle plate reverb and delay for space, with compression and saturation reserved for the peak sections.\n\nArrangement\nIntro opens with solo piano and a soft ambient synth pad, hopeful and airy, slowly accumulating gentle texture with no percussion.\n\nChorus 1 enters with the lead vocal over a steady, medium-intensity groove: acoustic piano, clean electric guitar, light bass, and a soft drum pattern; intimate and yearning, with the first backing harmonies joining underneath.\n\nVerse 1 builds momentum as the full band enters — drums, bass, and rhythmic guitars — with a driving rhythm and a slightly more forward, breathy vocal delivery.\n\nChorus 2 erupts into an explosive, full-band climax: driving drums, full string pads, and distorted guitar accents, with layered harmonies supporting the now powerful, belted lead.\n\nVerse 2 pulls back to a tense, rhythmic feel with bass and drums prominent and sparse guitar chords, the vocal dropping into an intimate chest register with pleading vulnerability.\n\nChorus 3 restores the full-band density with soaring strings and synth layers, loud and anthemic, sustaining the cathartic energy.\n\nBridge strips the arrangement down to rhythmic piano, pulsing bass, and filtered drums in a tense, rhythmic breakdown; the vocal strains and breaks into falsetto before the section builds into a crescendo.\n\nChorus 4 peaks with a grand, maximalist arrangement — full orchestral sweep, heavy drums, and epic guitar leads — double-tracked lead with call-and-response harmonies pushing to maximum intensity.\n\nChorus 5 keeps the band full but begins to simplify, the vocal slightly subdued yet powerful, starting the resolution with resigned emotion.\n\nOutro decrescendos as instruments drop out one by one; breathy ad-libs and sustained notes linger over fading piano and strings, ending on a solitary piano chord for a bittersweet finish."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Text", "title": "caption", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [441.9466247558594, 192.27301025390625], "pos": [2162.688720703125, 1226.8245849609375], "id": 80, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 10}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "pixaromaGroups": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.48.7", "VHS_latentpreview": true, "ds": {"offset": [-1945.6890413699925, -873.3413588020876], "scale": 0.6588450000000028}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags":